xt":["——来自海王星的奇迹之石，覆盖海王星地表的钻石海洋结晶。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["议论与惊叹声此起彼伏，人们注视着那颗美丽的晶体。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["从结构上来讲，它是一颗钻石。和我们所熟知的“经过琢磨的金刚石”并无不同。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,153,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011945","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但它的特殊之处在于——这颗美丽的石头，它来自45亿公里之外。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/xingkong.jpg","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["就像此前的每一次一样，旅行者2号上搭载了空间传送的神秘学术式，作为我们获取来自其他星球物质样本的尝试。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但此前的每一次，正如大家所知，这些尝试都以失败告终了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["尽管神秘学家们提出空间上距离的远近并非术式无法生效的真正原因，超远距离的空间传送仍然被认为是不可能的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"6207403","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["因此进入80年代后，各国航天局为了节省开支，便不再为空间探测器搭载类似的神秘学术式。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307411.png","audio":"6207404#1|1|1|1|1|1|1|1","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["——直到旅行者2号探测器飞越海王星，我们收到了这份来自遥远星球的礼物。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,152,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/xingkong.jpg","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["关于这颗远道而来的瑰丽钻石，仍然有许多谜团尚未破解。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们都知道旅行者2号于1989年8月25日抵达了最接近海王星的那个坐标。但这颗钻石被传送回来的时间却晚于那一日许多。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是超远距离传送的神秘术和普通传送术式如此不同，以至于会产生这般巨大的传送时间差吗？由于缺乏其他案例，我们暂时无从得知。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6207402","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["根据航天中心的报告，在这颗美丽的石头出现时，那个复杂而精密的术式的确首次成功运转了起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但同时，检测系统却也发现了不属于该术式的神秘术痕迹。它